# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Figures under assets/ are versioned with REGULAR git — never git-LFS.
#
# Deliberate exception, parallel to the ep4500 checkpoint bundled in
# reproduce/.../checkpoint/ (re-included past the root *.pt ignore). Here we
# override the repo-root .gitattributes `*.pdf filter=lfs …` rule so that every
# figure committed under assets/ is a plain git blob. Rationale: these figures are
# small, are embedded in READMEs (PNG renders inline on GitHub; an LFS-tracked PDF
# would not), and keeping them out of LFS is consistent with retiring the LFS
# dependency. PNG is already regular-git; the *.pdf/*.svg lines future-proof the
# subtree in case a vector figure is added.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.png -filter -diff -merge -text
*.jpg -filter -diff -merge -text
*.svg -filter -diff -merge -text
*.pdf -filter -diff -merge -text
